{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00270",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 3.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Right, come in and get settled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.24,
      "end_seconds": 7.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.58,
      "end_seconds": 19.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 20.32,
      "end_seconds": 23.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Doctor, it's hives. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.95,
      "end_seconds": 26.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.39,
      "end_seconds": 32.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "For one week, I'd say. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.55,
      "end_seconds": 43.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.82,
      "end_seconds": 52.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "So, it's worse with heat. Honestly, a few times a day. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.57,
      "end_seconds": 59.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Yeah, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 59.97,
      "end_seconds": 64.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.6,
      "end_seconds": 67.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.13,
      "end_seconds": 77.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything. Any swelling of the lips as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.36,
      "end_seconds": 79.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.47,
      "end_seconds": 82.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.07,
      "end_seconds": 87.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Yeah, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 88.28,
      "end_seconds": 90.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.1,
      "end_seconds": 93.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Has there been any joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.79,
      "end_seconds": 95.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No, no joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.99,
      "end_seconds": 98.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.8,
      "end_seconds": 102.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 104.16,
      "end_seconds": 109.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Hmm, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.64,
      "end_seconds": 116.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.82,
      "end_seconds": 123.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any throat tightness, trouble breathing or wheezing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.47,
      "end_seconds": 137.5,
      "duration_seconds": 13.03,
      "text": "Well, no, no throat tightness, no trouble breathing, no wheezing. I did have a burning feeling on the skin at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.18,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.3,
      "end_seconds": 147.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "No, um, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.22,
      "end_seconds": 150.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.02,
      "end_seconds": 154.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.15,
      "end_seconds": 157.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.23,
      "end_seconds": 162.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.26,
      "end_seconds": 165.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.03,
      "end_seconds": 171.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "For nearly five years. Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 171.35,
      "end_seconds": 179.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Doctor, um, I think the last prescription for the aspirin was 37.5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.96,
      "end_seconds": 185.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.89,
      "end_seconds": 197.33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.44,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed. I was on Asthalin inhaler before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.61,
      "end_seconds": 201.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.47,
      "end_seconds": 206.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.23,
      "end_seconds": 210.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.22,
      "end_seconds": 214.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Well, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.1,
      "end_seconds": 217.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.05,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "I have asthma, for nearly five years. Eczema, for nearly five years. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I have heart disease. Yes, arthritis in my knees. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "Okay, eczema, that's already on your record. Good to know. Right, so that's your known arthritis in my knees. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.21,
      "end_seconds": 251.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Yes, I had a stent put in my heart, two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.25,
      "end_seconds": 253.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.56,
      "end_seconds": 257.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 258.47,
      "end_seconds": 270.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 18, BMI works out to 20.6, temperature 36.7, height 159 centimetres, pulse is 82 beats a minute, blood pressure 123 over 80, weight 52 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.02,
      "end_seconds": 274.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.38,
      "end_seconds": 279.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.76,
      "end_seconds": 281.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.91,
      "end_seconds": 286.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.1,
      "end_seconds": 304.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "There are raised pink welts on the chest and back, some joined together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.89,
      "end_seconds": 309.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.34,
      "end_seconds": 330.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Lips look a little puffy, but the tongue and throat are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.84,
      "end_seconds": 356.82,
      "duration_seconds": 21.98,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with acute urticaria, possibly allergic at this stage. It could also be a viral trigger, so we'll keep that open. It could also be a drug reaction, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.5,
      "end_seconds": 361.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.33,
      "end_seconds": 375.71,
      "duration_seconds": 13.38,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute urticaria, possibly allergic, but I'd like to confirm. Let's get an allergy test, for recurrent urticaria. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_6",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 377.07,
      "end_seconds": 381.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 3:30 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.49,
      "end_seconds": 384.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Monday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.83,
      "end_seconds": 392.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for urticaria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.92,
      "end_seconds": 393.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.26,
      "end_seconds": 400.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "I'm prescribing prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day, for three days. It's for hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.76,
      "end_seconds": 405.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Um, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.93,
      "end_seconds": 429.46,
      "duration_seconds": 23.53,
      "text": "Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.04,
      "end_seconds": 432.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 435.97,
      "end_seconds": 447.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "If your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Please come and see me in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 447.88,
      "end_seconds": 449.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.44,
      "end_seconds": 454.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 455.95,
      "end_seconds": 460.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Yeah, um, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}